<VI _name="RemoteVI Demo.vi" description="RemoteVI example\3A a data logger operated from a web browser. RemoteVI Start.vi shares this panel on port 8088 (this computer only)\3B Remote Link shows the link with its access token - open it in a browser. The tabs hold the logger\27s configuration (acquisition\2C channels\2C trigger\2C logging - one control of every common kind)\2C Acquire starts and stops four simulated channels on the Live Data graph\2C Apply asks for confirmation in a LabVIEW dialog and Load Configuration opens the native file dialog - both are answered in the browser like the panel is operated. Quit stops the logger and RemoteVI Stop.vi ends the share. The data are simulated\3B nothing is written to disk.">
